    {
      "id": "EVID-FR08-CART-NOT-CLEARED",
      "type": "bug-runtime-report",
      "description": "Canonical FR-08 run, iteration 30 (FR08-AI-031). Top card: POST /api/checkout returns 200 {\"message\":\"Checkout successful\",\"orderId\":27}. Bottom card: the post-checkout GET /api/cart read-back still returns [{\"id\":1,\"name\":\"San pham A\",\"price\":100000,\"quantity\":2}], and the test table shows the failed assertion 'FR08-AI-031 cart is cleared after a successful checkout (FR-08)' with 'expected 1 to equal +0'. Note for the reader: htmlextra attributes pm.sendRequest helper calls to the enclosing item, which is why the Verify card displays the helper cart read-back rather than the order-history call. X-Student-Id 23127179 is visible in the request headers.",
